0.022,0.289,0.222,0.078,0.107,0.105,0.164,0.189,0.222,0.155,0.357,0.929,0.982,0.791,0.159,0.006,0.008,0.373,0.321,0.22,0.566,0.517,0.27,0.281,0.205,0.278,0.228,0.133,0.034],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"NARRATOR: The Capital of Laresveila, a city with more magic history than it would like to admit. A commuter stuffs themselves into a crystal-powered propulsor tram, firing a suspicious look at the unhoused Fae in the alley outside. A man slides a cursed letter through the crack in the door, hoping the witch who made it didn’t hold back. A vitriolic aircast cries the dangers of Portal Park, still wild and overgrown despite being cleaved from the Fae realms during the Severing 20 years ago. Resentment seeps from the cracks in the pavement; this town is a cracked mirror, one bad day from shattering. NARRATOR: Few feel it teetering more than Farron Augustine , an illegal seer who gives unsanctioned readings to souls desperate enough to pay. He works out of the Pick-You-Up café, wreathed in the scent of their mood-enhancing brews, his usual table adorned with the exotic trappings the locals expect. Most notably the filigreed porcelain teacups, hand-painted by his family back in Moerway, with a delicate pot to match. Farron pours a fragrant brew for his sour-faced guest.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":15.328,"end":88.224,"frac":0.957,"status":"ok","matched":178,"words":186},"large":{"start":15.328,"end":88.224,"frac":0.973,"status":"ok","matched":181,"words":186},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"FARRON: My friend, I can only help you if you take the ritual seriously.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":90.176,"end":93.376,"frac":0.929,"status":"ok","matched":13,"words":14},"large":{"start":90.176,"end":93.376,"frac":0.929,"status":"ok","matched":13,"words":14},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"NARRATOR: Ever since this customer stepped into the coffee shop and they locked eyes, a sense of unease swept away Farron’s good humour. The joys of being a seer; so in tune with fate you can make money off the future, so in tune you can ruin your whole day and never know why. All you can hope is to feel your way out of fate.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":94.048,"end":114.36,"frac":0.97,"status":"ok","matched":64,"words":66},"large":{"start":94.048,"end":114.304,"frac":0.985,"status":"ok","matched":65,"words":66},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"NIYAM: Yes, yes, turn the cup.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":115.008,"end":117.472,"frac":0.833,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":6},"large":{"start":115.008,"end":117.472,"frac":0.833,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":6},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"FARRON: Clockwise. Careful, keep it in the saucer – otherwise they won’t settle right.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":118.208,"end":123.36,"frac":0.923,"status":"ok","matched":12,"words":13},"large":{"start":118.208,"end":123.36,"frac":0.923,"status":"ok","matched":12,"words":13},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"NIYAM: I want that real Moerway reading, you get me? No grifter bullshit.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":124.096,"end":128.256,"frac":0.923,"status":"ok","matched":12,"words":13},"large":{"start":124.096,"end":128.256,"frac":0.923,"status":"ok","matched":12,"words":13},"differ":false},{"i":6,"text":"NARRATOR: Hmm. A little insensitive to discount Farron’s years of practice, but Farron just gives him a wry smile.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":129.28,"end":137.216,"frac":0.632,"status":"ok","matched":12,"words":19},"large":{"start":129.28,"end":137.216,"frac":0.947,"status":"ok","matched":18,"words":19},"differ":false},{"i":7,"text":"FARRON: Now take the last sip, Niyam .","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":137.888,"end":140.02,"frac":0.714,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":7},"large":{"start":137.888,"end":140.448,"frac":0.714,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":7},"differ":false},{"i":8,"text":"NARRATOR: Finally he does it. Farron considers giving him a portent of doom for fun – but a passing protester in the street outside reminds him what happens to seers who don’t satisfy.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":140.02,"end":153.54,"frac":0.969,"status":"ok","matched":31,"words":32},"large":{"start":141.312,"end":153.952,"frac":0.969,"status":"ok","matched":31,"words":32},"differ":true},{"i":9,"text":"FARRON: Let me take a look… hmm…","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":154.688,"end":155.56,"frac":0.714,"status":"ok","matched":5,"words":7},"large":{"start":154.688,"end":158.24,"frac":0.857,"status":"ok","matched":6,"words":7},"differ":true},{"i":10,"text":"NIYAM: [ grumbles ]","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":2},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":2},"differ":false},{"i":11,"text":"NARRATOR: Damn it, of all the times for a cloudy reading . That clump could be a cloud, or an axe? Farron could spin a yarn so Niyam’ll leave smiling, but the man asked for the real deal. Farron reaches for his symbol cards.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":162.304,"end":180.288,"frac":0.907,"status":"ok","matched":39,"words":43},"large":{"start":162.304,"end":180.288,"frac":0.953,"status":"ok","matched":41,"words":43},"differ":false},{"i":12,"text":"FARRON [ sighing ]: … Listen, buddy. I promise I wouldn’t do this if I didn’t have to.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":181.568,"end":184.704,"frac":0.867,"status":"ok","matched":13,"words":15},"large":{"start":181.568,"end":184.704,"frac":0.867,"status":"ok","matched":13,"words":15},"differ":false},{"i":13,"text":"NIYAM: Send that shit to the Fae Realms! You want me to pay more for your rottin’ seer lies?","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":185.088,"end":190.368,"frac":0.842,"status":"ok","matched":16,"words":19},"large":{"start":185.088,"end":190.3,"frac":0.842,"status":"ok","matched":16,"words":19},"differ":false},{"i":14,"text":"FARRON: I’m not running an illegal underground charity here, Niyam.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":190.56,"end":194.24,"frac":0.8,"status":"ok","matched":8,"words":10},"large":{"start":190.56,"end":194.24,"frac":0.9,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":10},"differ":false},{"i":15,"text":"NIYAM: Fine.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":2},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":2},"differ":false},{"i":16,"text":"FARRON: Thank you.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":196.704,"end":198.56,"frac":0.667,"status":"ok","matched":2,"words":3},"large":{"start":196.704,"end":198.56,"frac":0.667,"status":"ok","matched":2,"words":3},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/6ab6d97cb455c_5-1c.jpg"}